{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 7756314860563842611,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Energy-Aware Scheduling (EAS)",
      "source_hash": 10674752040719812857,
      "context_hash": 2563603501329927476,
      "translation": "에너지 인지 스케줄링(Energy-Aware Scheduling, EAS)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195944Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Minimizing energy consumption on heterogeneous CPU topologies",
      "source_hash": 11134438370412351375,
      "context_hash": 11002792714535309008,
      "translation": "이기종 CPU 토폴로지에서의 에너지 소비 최소화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195945Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Motivation",
      "source_hash": 5845298202555182368,
      "context_hash": 11381096068690900910,
      "translation": "동기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195945Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "On ARM big.LITTLE and Intel hybrid (P+E core) CPUs, different cores have different performance *and* energy characteristics.",
      "source_hash": 11734410349508072758,
      "context_hash": 2827385192009276290,
      "translation": "ARM big.LITTLE 및 Intel 하이브리드(P+E 코어) CPU에서는 코어마다 성능*과* 에너지 특성이 서로 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "Intel": "Intel"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195946Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "EAS was originally merged in Linux 5.0 for ARM big.LITTLE by Quentin Perret (ARM) — [`732cd75b8c92`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/732cd75b8c920d3727e69957b14faa7c2d7c3b75) ([patch series](https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20181203095628.11858-1-quentin.perret@arm.com/), [LWN](https://lwn.net/Articles/772475/)).",
      "source_hash": 11840538015192365270,
      "context_hash": 6968828567848105730,
      "translation": "EAS는 원래 Quentin Perret(ARM)가 ARM big.LITTLE용으로 Linux 5.0에 병합했습니다 — [`732cd75b8c92`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/732cd75b8c920d3727e69957b14faa7c2d7c3b75)([패치 시리즈](https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20181203095628.11858-1-quentin.perret@arm.com/), [LWN](https://lwn.net/Articles/772475/)).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "patch series": "패치 시리즈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195946Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Intel hybrid (P+E core) support was added in Linux 6.16 by Rafael J. Wysocki — [`7b010f9b9061`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/7b010f9b906107ae4e5ac626329ab818b3f0a6b6).",
      "source_hash": 11945058689760454923,
      "context_hash": 17819052268369052502,
      "translation": "Intel 하이브리드(P+E 코어) 지원은 Rafael J. Wysocki가 Linux 6.16에 추가했습니다 — [`7b010f9b9061`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/7b010f9b906107ae4e5ac626329ab818b3f0a6b6).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Intel": "Intel",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195947Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "A compute-intensive task should run on a big/P-core.",
      "source_hash": 3982027420688007023,
      "context_hash": 17425463783291273937,
      "translation": "연산 집약적인 태스크는 big/P-코어에서 실행되어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195948Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "An idle background task should park on a LITTLE/E-core.",
      "source_hash": 10790608051177987100,
      "context_hash": 1334660465724939862,
      "translation": "유휴 상태의 백그라운드 태스크는 LITTLE/E-코어에 머물러야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195948Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "EAS makes this decision based on an energy model of the hardware.",
      "source_hash": 11650158663119166374,
      "context_hash": 16179076024627463658,
      "translation": "EAS는 하드웨어의 에너지 모델을 바탕으로 이 결정을 내립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195948Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Energy model",
      "source_hash": 17591793313050880700,
      "context_hash": 1210769433218622934,
      "translation": "에너지 모델",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195948Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The energy model describes the power consumption of each CPU at different utilization levels:",
      "source_hash": 12014479107467725434,
      "context_hash": 15925820387592841536,
      "translation": "에너지 모델은 각 CPU의 이용률 수준별 전력 소비를 기술합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195949Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The energy model is registered by cpufreq drivers or device tree:",
      "source_hash": 17016034660057537476,
      "context_hash": 3621040591077456229,
      "translation": "에너지 모델은 cpufreq 드라이버나 디바이스 트리가 등록합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cpufreq": "cpufreq",
        "device": "디바이스",
        "drivers": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195949Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "CPU capacity",
      "source_hash": 13811274408295927292,
      "context_hash": 2100728523326429072,
      "translation": "CPU 용량",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195949Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "EAS models each CPU's maximum compute capacity (normalized to 1024):",
      "source_hash": 16180056657004926555,
      "context_hash": 4814030459432504647,
      "translation": "EAS는 각 CPU의 최대 연산 용량(capacity)을 모델링합니다(1024로 정규화):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195949Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "A LITTLE core running at 1.0 GHz vs a big core at 2.5 GHz might have capacity 400 vs 1024.",
      "source_hash": 4899902730243302380,
      "context_hash": 10878971702164340381,
      "translation": "1.0 GHz로 동작하는 LITTLE 코어와 2.5 GHz로 동작하는 big 코어의 용량은 각각 400과 1024 정도일 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195949Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "find_energy_efficient_cpu",
      "source_hash": 6436078311854209671,
      "context_hash": 9556844997083249653,
      "translation": "find_energy_efficient_cpu",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195950Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The core EAS function selects the CPU that minimizes total system energy:",
      "source_hash": 5458150010904866709,
      "context_hash": 10305786240150439987,
      "translation": "EAS의 핵심 함수는 전체 시스템 에너지를 최소화하는 CPU를 선택합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "function": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195950Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "compute_energy",
      "source_hash": 551911939897697970,
      "context_hash": 13175476821003740595,
      "translation": "compute_energy",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195950Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Energy estimation for placing a task on a specific CPU:",
      "source_hash": 9148305057587722772,
      "context_hash": 12437562776615736317,
      "translation": "특정 CPU에 태스크를 배치할 때의 에너지 추정:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195950Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Capacity-aware wakeup",
      "source_hash": 14406133551216120173,
      "context_hash": 8637375639914279913,
      "translation": "용량 인지 웨이크업",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195950Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Before EAS runs its full energy computation, a simpler capacity check prevents placing a task on a CPU that's already saturated:",
      "source_hash": 14334037613934310415,
      "context_hash": 12454828426415678117,
      "translation": "EAS가 전체 에너지 계산을 수행하기 전에, 더 간단한 용량 검사를 통해 이미 포화된 CPU에 태스크가 배치되는 것을 막습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195950Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "When the system is overutilized (some CPU at 100%), EAS falls back to the regular load balancer — energy optimization doesn't help when you're already maxed out.",
      "source_hash": 14342007563887383669,
      "context_hash": 17162542456210066643,
      "translation": "시스템이 과이용(overutilized) 상태(어떤 CPU가 100%)이면 EAS는 일반 로드 밸런서로 대체됩니다 — 이미 한계에 도달한 상태에서는 에너지 최적화가 도움이 되지 않기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195951Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Schedutil + EAS interaction",
      "source_hash": 3082687575131114841,
      "context_hash": 5255367109725564263,
      "translation": "Schedutil + EAS 상호작용",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195951Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "EAS determines *which* CPU; schedutil determines *which frequency*:",
      "source_hash": 3093765988397132626,
      "context_hash": 10593124319066063154,
      "translation": "EAS는 *어느* CPU인지를 결정하고, schedutil은 *어느 주파수*인지를 결정합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195952Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Observing EAS",
      "source_hash": 1222572047170553850,
      "context_hash": 6260204875731480541,
      "translation": "EAS 관찰하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195952Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "big.LITTLE Linux support",
      "source_hash": 6510579842801176883,
      "context_hash": 15077047028210135103,
      "translation": "big.LITTLE Linux 지원",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195952Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Thermal pressure",
      "source_hash": 16504277782106502473,
      "context_hash": 15814439880666301134,
      "translation": "열 압력(thermal pressure)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195952Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a CPU is thermally throttled, its capacity is temporarily reduced.",
      "source_hash": 12193636495204537601,
      "context_hash": 13554271966814029523,
      "translation": "CPU가 열 스로틀링되면 그 용량이 일시적으로 줄어듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195952Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "EAS accounts for this:",
      "source_hash": 9440406728259179229,
      "context_hash": 1755831671591976238,
      "translation": "EAS는 이를 고려합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:52:39.195952Z",
      "issues": []
    },
